# Royal Elementor Addons - Frontend CSS

`assets/css/frontend.min.css` is the editable frontend stylesheet for runtime widget styling updates.

When adding or updating frontend widget styles:

- Edit **`assets/css/frontend.min.css`** directly.
- Keep additions minified and scoped to REA selectors (e.g. `.wpr-*`).
- Do not inject widget styles inline in PHP render methods.

